      ],
      "en": "“Let’s break their bonds apart, and cast their cords from us.”",
      "ko": "우리가 그 맨 것을 끊고 그 결박을 벗어 버리자 하도다",
      "source_text_hash": "cdcfc6e04ed1669a8e1f87b907f39fd3154ed8d91a615de89a743063e3696afb",
      "translation_text_hash": "7be4bcf334e0fe8cfb4df379683ea2a8a6e5f747fd098dee631c1771d63b980d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
