      "en": "Then he will speak to them in his anger, and terrify them in his wrath:",
      "ko": "그 때에 분을 발하며 진노하사 저희를 놀래어 이르시기를",
      "source_text_hash": "ef0cba666a211736dac13d2d89baac742bf030431411cd6f704845a9eb45d6a0",
      "translation_text_hash": "fc43114cf414ba11c4bed86e896f5ab3ad4326906ff29d32299052c21f661025",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 때에 분을 발하며 진노하사 저희를 놀래어 이르시기를"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "fc43114cf414ba11c4bed86e896f5ab3ad4326906ff29d32299052c21f661025"
      ]
    },
