      "en": "“Yet I have set my King on my holy hill of Zion.”",
      "ko": "내가 나의 왕을 내 거룩한 산 시온에 세웠다 하시리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "c4173ea32af939a5e784f458b2149be6b0e45d9ec36b91bcf97cdf99411b139e",
      "translation_text_hash": "2597b68041f97b8b911f9e98ee6adab2a55420aeb83c910fece11872da4431f0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
