      "en": "You shall break them with a rod of iron. You shall dash them in pieces like a potter’s vessel.”",
      "ko": "네가 철장으로 저희를 깨뜨림이여 질그릇 같이 부수리라 하시도다",
      "source_text_hash": "0b9b68bf062a11faa705441e7d77032c2201bee33beee4644fc2a0d4ce685fc1",
      "translation_text_hash": "c201d9f3df462987631eaeee5bb12378358191164f2d9ff9662c737716694eb2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
